.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH list 1  "list " 
.SH NAME
list \- List local snippets
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBlist\fR [\fB\-\-tag\fR] [\fB\-\-long\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
List local snippets
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-tag\fR \fI<TAG>\fR
Only show snippets with this tag
.TP
\fB\-\-long\fR
Show mode, shell and hash for each snippet
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH EXTRA
Examples:
  fg list \-\-long
  fg list \-\-tag ubuntu
